# Runtime output. The kernel log now defaults to %TEMP%\ssx_recomp\, but it
# still lands in the working directory when XBOX_KERNEL_LOG points here or the
# temp path cannot be opened -- and frame captures go wherever XBOX_D3D_DUMP
# says. Neither belongs in the tree: both are regenerated every run, and stray
# copies had accumulated in the build output, in tools/audit/ and here.
xbox_kernel.log
*.bmp
